@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@orderId = replace-with-phone-order-id
@trackingToken = replace-with-private-tracking-token

### Customer invoice: no JWT or outlet header required
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/phone-orders/{{orderId}}/invoice?token={{trackingToken}}

### Invalid or missing token returns 404, never an invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/phone-orders/{{orderId}}/invoice
